sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as "Blazor WASM Client\n(PoRedoImage.Client)"
    participant Server as "Blazor SSR Server\n(PoRedoImage.Web)"
    participant API as "Minimal API Layer"
    participant Orch as "ImageAnalysisOrchestrator"
    participant CV as "Azure Computer Vision"
    participant OpenAI as "Azure OpenAI GPT-4.1-nano"
    participant Gemini as "Gemini Imagen3"
    participant Tables as "Azure Table Storage"

    Note over Client,Server: Interactive Server mode — SignalR circuit active
    Client->>Server: ComponentBase.OnInitializedAsync()
    Server-->>Client: Initial render (SSR pre-render)

    Note over Client,API: Image Upload + Analysis
    Client->>Client: File selected → FileReader.readAsDataURL
    Client->>Server: StateHasChanged (loading=true)
    Client->>API: HttpClient.PostAsJsonAsync("/api/images/analyze", request)
    API->>API: ValidationFilter — model validation
    API->>Orch: ProcessAsync(request, ct)

    par Computer Vision
        Orch->>CV: POST /vision/v3.2/analyze?features=tags,description
        CV-->>Orch: AnalysisResult {tags, description, confidence}
    end

    Orch->>OpenAI: chat.completions (enhance description or meme caption)
    OpenAI-->>Orch: ChatCompletion {enhancedText, usage.total_tokens}

    Orch->>Gemini: generateContent (image-to-image)
    Gemini-->>Orch: GenerateContentResponse {inlineData.data bytes}

    Orch-->>API: ImageAnalysisResponse
    API-->>Client: 200 OK {Description, RegeneratedImageData, Tags, Metrics}

    Client->>Server: StateHasChanged (result rendered)
    Server-->>Client: ImageRegenerationResultsPanel / MemeResultsPanel updated

    Note over Client,Tables: State Sync — Save to Gallery
    Client->>API: POST /api/user-images/save-result
    API->>Tables: TableClient.UpsertEntityAsync(UserImage)
    Tables-->>API: ETag response
    API-->>Client: 200 OK SaveImageResponse {Id, ImageUrl}
    Client->>Server: Gallery count badge updated via StateHasChanged

    Note over Client,Gemini: Conflict Resolution — Bulk Generate Concurrency
    Client->>Client: _slots[0..9] initialized\nConcurrentDictionary slot state
    loop 10 parallel slots (no await between)
        Client->>API: POST /api/bulk-generate/variation {Prompt+description, imageBytes}
        API->>Gemini: Imagen3 generateContent
        Gemini-->>API: variation bytes
        API-->>Client: 200 OK {VariationImageData}
        Client->>Server: StateHasChanged slot N complete
    end
    Note over Client: Results render incrementally as each slot resolves\nNo slot blocks another — Task.WhenAll coordination
